  m_text: "\u25CF An entity that evolved a <b>Hyper-active Immune System</b> to survive
    in extreme water pressure environments.\r\n\u25CF Specific enzymes within its
    tentacle mucus induce explosive proliferation of immune cells, resulting in abnormally
    fast tissue regeneration rates.\r\n\u25CF Uncontrolled <b><color=#FFCC00>cellular
    hyper-proliferation</color></b> phenomena reported in some test subjects."
